{"id":"88497c28c97d78b7","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure.md","title":"本原递归关系的布尔与有界闭包","display":"thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure — 本原递归关系的布尔与有界闭包","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure","aliases":["18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure"],"display":"thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure — 本原递归关系的布尔与有界闭包","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]","[[18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"Lemma 2.2.2","source_printed_pages":"12–13","source_pdf_pages":"23–24","source_correspondence":"boolean-bounded-quantifier-and-substitution-closure","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure — 本原递归关系的布尔与有界闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc21fff5179104fc\" href=\"?note=dc21fff5179104fc\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation\">18-df-primitive-recursive-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"544534f7ba36ba34\" href=\"?note=544534f7ba36ba34\" title=\"18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure\">18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemma 2.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12–13"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"23–24"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"boolean-bounded-quantifier-and-substitution-closure"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\">\\(R,S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_m\">\\(Q\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> 及特征函数约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc21fff5179104fc\" href=\"?note=dc21fff5179104fc\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation\">18-df-primitive-recursive-relation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_1,\\ldots,g_m\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n\">\\(g_1,\\ldots,g_m\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n\\)</span>；函数闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"544534f7ba36ba34\" href=\"?note=544534f7ba36ba34\" title=\"18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure\">18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,\\vec z)\">\\((y,\\vec z)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec z\">\\(\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_P,A_P\">\\(E_P,A_P\\)</span> 为下式定义的关系，其中第一坐标是输入界，不是预先固定的常数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\vec g}\">\\(Q_{\\vec g}\\)</span> 为代入后的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_P\\coloneqq\\{(x,\\vec z)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}:\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_P\\coloneqq\\{(x,\\vec z)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}:\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_P\\coloneqq\\{(x,\\vec z)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}:\\forall y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_P\\coloneqq\\{(x,\\vec z)\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}:\\forall y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\vec g}\\coloneqq\\{\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n:\n\\langle g_1(\\vec z),\\ldots,g_m(\\vec z)\\rangle\\in Q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_{\\vec g}\\coloneqq\\{\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n:\n\\langle g_1(\\vec z),\\ldots,g_m(\\vec z)\\rangle\\in Q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^n\\setminus R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\\land\nR\\cap S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\\land R\\cup S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N^n\\setminus R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\\land\nR\\cap S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n\\land R\\cup S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_P,A_P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1},\\qquad Q_{\\vec g}\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_P,A_P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1},\\qquad Q_{\\vec g}\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核 Lemma 2.2.2 的陈述和全部证明。补关系的特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-\\chi_R\">\\(1-\\chi_R\\)</span>，交为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R\\chi_S\">\\(\\chi_R\\chi_S\\)</span>，并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min(1,\\chi_R+\\chi_S)\">\\(\\min(1,\\chi_R+\\chi_S)\\)</span>。有界存在的特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min(1,\\sum_{y=0}^{x}\\chi_P(y,\\vec z))\">\\(\\min(1,\\sum_{y=0}^{x}\\chi_P(y,\\vec z))\\)</span>，有界全称的特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{y=0}^{x}\\chi_P(y,\\vec z)\">\\(\\prod_{y=0}^{x}\\chi_P(y,\\vec z)\\)</span>；这些有限和、积由带参数的自然数递归构造，截断到 0/1 的函数由零与后继两分支递归构造。关系代入的特征函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_Q(g_1(\\vec z),\\ldots,g_m(\\vec z))\">\\(\\chi_Q(g_1(\\vec z),\\ldots,g_m(\\vec z))\\)</span>，故由函数复合闭包得到结论。</p>\n<p>新增前已搜索本目录全部原子及 glossary。006 只给固定界的全称截面，bounded-search 给最小见证函数；两者均未单列布尔、输入界量化与任意本原递归代入的统一闭包结论。本节点不改变已有 BAll 的固定界签名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation","status":"resolved","id":"dc21fff5179104fc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"544534f7ba36ba34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation","status":"resolved","id":"dc21fff5179104fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$m\\ge1$，$R,S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n$，$P\\in\