{x}\\chi_P(y,\\vec z))","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{y=0}^{x}\\chi_P(y,\\vec z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_Q(g_1(\\vec z),\\ldots,g_m(\\vec z))","display":false}],"bytes":2677,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c1845536b726c45","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega$ 与本原递归函数项见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]；其布尔、有界闭包见 [[18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]。本节点在 ZFC 中固定一套本地数码，不把“标准 Kleene 编码”作为未定义参数。除已注明的函数项树之外，本节点的小写变量取自然数，$\\vec a$ 为有限自然数列。$\\operatorname{sc}$ 编码有限列，$\\operatorname{len},\\operatorname{hd},\\operatorname{tl},[\\ ]_i$ 在全部自然数上定义；越界分量为 $0$。$a(e)$ 是程序元数加一，非法程序取 $0$，因此零元程序不与非法程序混同。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["dc21fff5179104fc","544534f7ba36ba34"]}